WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.652 --> 00:00:15.976
"We have to get out of here!"

2
00:00:16.296 --> 00:00:16.996
Roxy shouted.

3
00:00:18.077 --> 00:00:20.597
She, Cozlin, and Wukong pounded on the thick door.

4
00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:23.758
A lifeless Bippo clung to her shoulder.

5
00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:29.820
Roxy clicked on her communication device, but all she heard was static.

6
00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:33.725
"Terrell? Dr.

7
00:00:33.885 --> 00:00:36.487
Odd?" She groaned.

8
00:00:36.507 --> 00:00:41.772
"We can't communicate with anyone from in here!"

9
00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:45.114
"This is awful!"

10
00:00:45.474 --> 00:00:46.235
Cozlin said.

11
00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:50.679
"We should have escaped through the door before Meltron closed it."

12
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.021
Roxy frowned.

13
00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:55.703
"Well, why didn't you?"

14
00:00:55.723 --> 00:00:58.145
"Huh?" Cozlin said.

15
00:00:58.165 --> 00:01:02.048
"You have super speed," Roxy said.

16
00:01:02.976 --> 00:01:05.717
"You could have flown out before Meltron closed the door."

17
00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:09.238
"I was saving Wukong!"

18
00:01:09.558 --> 00:01:10.338
Cozlin said.

19
00:01:10.358 --> 00:01:12.839
"Why didn't you escape?"

20
00:01:12.859 --> 00:01:17.220
"I was trying to fire my eye laser beams!"

21
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:18.440
Roxy said.

22
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.941
"Stop arguing!"

23
00:01:21.361 --> 00:01:22.201
Wukong said.

24
00:01:22.221 --> 00:01:25.242
"I'm not even supposed to be in this world.

25
00:01:26.803 --> 00:01:29.523
I'd much rather be in my own world, fighting dumb demons!"

26
00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.424
He sighed.

27
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:33.697
"I thought this would be exciting.

28
00:01:33.717 --> 00:01:36.139
I miss being bored!"

29
00:01:36.159 --> 00:01:39.942
"Poor you," Roxy said.

30
00:01:39.962 --> 00:01:42.344
"I never get to be bored!

31
00:01:43.304 --> 00:01:48.048
I'm always flying around, fighting villains and saving Metro City.

32
00:01:49.329 --> 00:01:54.172
And now I'm millions of light-years from home, trapped in a room full of lava!"

33
00:01:55.713 --> 00:01:56.814
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

34
00:01:56.834 --> 00:02:02.650
"This is why I like to work alone—I don't have to listen to anyone complaining!"

35
00:02:04.131 --> 00:02:05.733
For a moment nobody said anything.

36
00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:08.054
Then Roxy and Wukong laughed.

37
00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:14.500
Cozlin smiled and then burst into laughter too.

38
00:02:19.084 --> 00:02:20.204
are we going to do?"

39
00:02:20.685 --> 00:02:21.265
she asked.

40
00:02:21.285 --> 00:02:24.388
"There must be a way out of here."

41
00:02:24.408 --> 00:02:29.032
"Let's try to get the door open," Wukong said.

42
00:02:30.076 --> 00:02:33.118
"Maybe if we all work together, we can—" Boomf!

43
00:02:34.179 --> 00:02:36.440
A huge metal fist popped through the door.

44
00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:40.123
Boomf! Another fist popped through.

45
00:02:42.164 --> 00:02:45.586
Roxy gasped as the two hands began to pull the door apart.

46
00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:52.731
Creak! Soon there was a large opening and a robot stepped through.

47
00:02:52.751 --> 00:02:55.233
"It's Dr.

48
00:02:55.393 --> 00:02:56.334
Odd's robot!"

49
00:02:56.694 --> 00:02:57.454
Cozlin cried.

50
00:02:58.775 --> 00:02:59.756
Its head popped open.

51
00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:05.120
Roxy gasped.

52
00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:09.021
"Terrell!" Terrell grinned.

53
00:03:09.041 --> 00:03:11.442
"Call me Danger Dude!"

54
00:03:12.863 --> 00:03:13.643
Everyone laughed.

55
00:03:13.663 --> 00:03:19.124
"Okay, Danger Dude," Cozlin said.

56
00:03:19.144 --> 00:03:21.245
"We have to get out of here."

57
00:03:21.265 --> 00:03:23.906
"This whole place is going to self-destruct!"

58
00:03:24.226 --> 00:03:25.146
Wukong said.

59
00:03:28.047 --> 00:03:30.728
Once they were outside of the room, everyone's powers were back.

60
00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:36.260
"Awake, me!"

61
00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:36.821
Bippo said.

62
00:03:36.841 --> 00:03:40.263
"Hurry!" Roxy said.

63
00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:42.905
She and Cozlin flew up the tunnel.

64
00:03:44.066 --> 00:03:45.667
Wukong jumped onto his cloud.

65
00:03:48.048 --> 00:03:51.711
Terrell ran fast, making the robot's heavy feet pound the floor.

66
00:03:54.853 --> 00:03:57.595
They went past dozens of broken and lifeless robots.

67
00:03:59.056 --> 00:04:02.599
Lava bubbled up and filled the tunnel behind them.

68
00:04:02.619 --> 00:04:04.120
Everyone felt the terrible heat of it.

69
00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.080
"I see the exit!"

70
00:04:06.421 --> 00:04:07.121
Cozlin said.

71
00:04:07.141 --> 00:04:14.744
"Hurry!" The four heroes emerged onto the surface of Groon.

72
00:04:16.605 --> 00:04:19.226
They escaped fast as flames shot from the exit.

73
00:04:20.646 --> 00:04:23.348
Then a huge blast of lava shot high in the air.

74
00:04:24.568 --> 00:04:26.549
It showered back down on everyone.

75
00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:30.851
"Ack!" Roxy said as lava burned her cape.

76
00:04:31.911 --> 00:04:33.812
"Ouch!" Wukong said.

77
00:04:35.116 --> 00:04:37.158
Cozlin moved fast to avoid getting hit.

78
00:04:38.459 --> 00:04:39.860
Roxy inhaled deeply.

79
00:04:40.961 --> 00:04:42.442
Then she blew her freeze breath.

80
00:04:43.223 --> 00:04:46.946
Whoosh! The raining lava instantly cooled.

81
00:04:50.809 --> 00:04:52.951
But Groon was shaking violently now.

82
00:04:52.971 --> 00:04:56.354
"Quick!" Roxy said.

83
00:04:56.374 --> 00:04:58.736
"We have to get into Dr.

84
00:04:58.836 --> 00:04:59.477
Odd's moon!"

85
00:04:59.497 --> 00:05:01.418
"Where is it?"

86
00:05:01.839 --> 00:05:03.260
Cozlin asked, looking around.

87
00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:07.021
Roxy looked at the spot where the moon had been.

88
00:05:08.402 --> 00:05:10.023
She felt a lump form in her gut.

89
00:05:12.965 --> 00:05:14.886
Dr. Odd had left them behind!

90
00:05:14.906 --> 00:05:18.468
"Bad, him," Bippo said.
